   "szLabel": "MenuLabel",
   "szText": "\"I don't know.\"",
   "hLabel": 4215274549
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line12.BD31C",
   "szText": "You are honest, at least. Perhaps I owe you honesty as well.",
   "hLabel": 3208687302
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line14.BD31C",
   "szText": "I pity you. You are caught between the world you wish for and the world you live in, and you can choose neither.",
   "hLabel": 1496655944
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line16.BD31C",
   "szText": "But in that...you remind me of my son. And I miss my son terribly.",
   "hLabel": 4079591882
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "VoiceDir16.BD31C",
   "szText": "soft with feeling",
